<view class="page"><view class="section-title">人员与排班</view><view class="hint">关联实际账号，设置每位教练可服务的项目。管理员账号由部署时配置。</view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><view><view class="title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.enabled===false?'已停用':'已启用'}}</view></view><button class="btn btn-small" data-id="{{item.id || item._id}}" bindtap="edit">配置</button></view><button class="btn btn-secondary" data-id="{{item.id || item._id}}" bindtap="schedule">查看／维护排班</button></view><view wx:if="{{selectedId}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">配置 {{name}}</view><text class="label">实际账号 OpenID</text><input class="field" value="{{accountOpenid}}" bindinput="inputAccount" placeholder="从实际微信账号取得"/><text class="label">可服务项目</text><view class="wrap"><view wx:for="{{projects}}" wx:key="id" class="chip {{item.selected?'chip-on':''}}" data-id="{{item.id || item._id}}" bindtap="toggleProject">{{item.name}} · {{item.durationMinutes || item.duration}} 分钟</view></view><view class="row"><text class="label">人员状态</text><switch checked="{{enabled}}" bindchange="toggleEnabled"/></view><button class="btn" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="save">保存人员配置</button></view></view>

